WEBVTT

NOTE Draft subtitles for "business" — timed to the shot plan. Re-time to the final edit.

1
00:04.300 --> 00:06.800
Good morning, Hind!

2
00:07.300 --> 00:09.800
Good morning! Come in, the coffee’s ready.

3
00:10.300 --> 00:14.800
Lots of visitors this season — half my customers are from abroad.

4
00:15.300 --> 00:19.800
And they all ask: do you have digital payment? An app?

5
00:20.300 --> 00:25.800
Have you heard of Pi? My sister has an account — she says the community is big worldwide.

6
00:26.300 --> 00:29.800
But I don’t want to get into something I don’t understand.

7
00:30.300 --> 00:34.800
Neither do I. Look at this app — it explains everything calmly.

8
00:47.300 --> 00:49.800
So I set the price?

9
00:50.300 --> 00:55.800
Yes, and payment goes straight to your wallet. The app doesn’t hold anything.

10
00:56.300 --> 00:59.800
And if I decide, I can list my shop in the directory?

11
01:00.300 --> 01:04.800
It’s free, and they review it before publishing. But it’s your decision.

12
01:05.300 --> 01:08.800
Let me read more tonight.

13
01:13.300 --> 01:15.800
Discover Saudi Arabia. Explore useful digital tools. Learn about the Pi ecosystem with DigitalSaudi.
